# Tauri sidecar staging dir (RFC-L2-scripting §7 rider 9). The per-target
# posthastectl binary (posthastectl-<target-triple>[.exe]) is built/downloaded
# per platform and MUST NOT be committed:
#   - CI stages the signed release binaries (see .github/workflows/release.yml).
#   - Local builds stage a host binary via `just desktop stage-sidecar`.
*
!.gitignore
